<title>PORTUGAL: Oporto futures trade halted by technical problems.</title>
<headline>Oporto futures trade halted by technical problems.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in stock index and interest rate futures on the Oporto derivatives exchange was halted soon after the start on Friday by technical problems, traders said.</p>
<p>Today marks the start of trade in a future contract on Portugal Telecom stock and is the first anniversary of the exchange's launch.</p>
<p>There was no immediate explanation for the technical fault.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
